{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00815","headline":"郊庙歌辞 汉宗庙乐舞辞 积善舞 · 张昭","name":"郊庙歌辞 汉宗庙乐舞辞 积善舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黍稷斯馨，祖德惟明。\n蛇告赤帝，龟谋大横。\n云行雨施，天成地平。\n造我家邦，斡我璿衡。\n陶匏在御，醍盎惟精。\n或戛或击，载炮载烹。\n饮福受胙，舞降歌迎。\n滔滔不竭，洪惟水行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张昭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00815.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00815","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}